#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:1
msgid "引言"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:3
msgid "学习目标与核心概念"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:5
msgid "在深入探讨计算图、反向传播和梯度下降之前，我们先明确本章的学习目标："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:7
msgid "学习目标"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:10
msgid "**计算图直觉**：把数学运算看作\"数据流动\"的管道系统"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:11
msgid "**激活函数直觉**：理解非线性如何将线性不可分的数据\"折叠\"成可分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:12
msgid "**损失函数直觉**：理解不同目标如何塑造优化问题的几何结构"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:13
msgid "**反向传播直觉**：把最终误差\"分摊\"给每个参数（信用分配机制）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:14
msgid "**梯度下降直觉**：理解损失曲面的几何形状如何影响优化路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:15
msgid "**代码连接**：在PyTorch中观察这些机制的实际表现"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:18
msgid "机器学习的基本问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:20
msgid "机器学习的目标是让计算机从数据中自己发现规律，而不是我们一条条写规则。核心挑战是如何自动调整模型参数，让它能更好地拟合数据、做出准确预测。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:22
msgid "机器学习的核心挑战"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:25
msgid "**模型复杂度**：现代深度学习模型可能有数百万甚至数十亿个参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:26
msgid "**优化难度**：在如此高维的空间里找到最优解，就像在迷宫里找出口"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:27
msgid "**计算效率**：需要又快又省的算法处理海量数据和复杂模型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:28
msgid "**泛化能力**：模型不仅要在训练数据上表现好，还要在没见过的新数据上靠谱"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:31
msgid "为什么需要这些核心机制？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:33
msgid "神经网络训练涉及几个关键环节，每个环节都需要特定的数学工具："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:35
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`computational-graph`**：描述数据如何在网络中流动，为自动求导提供结构基础"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:36
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`activation-functions`**：引入非线性，让网络能够划分复杂的决策边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`loss-functions`**：定义\"预测好坏\"的度量，将训练转化为优化问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`back-propagation`**：高效计算梯度，完成误差的\"信用分配\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**{ref}`gradient-descent`**：利用梯度信息迭代优化参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:41
#, python-brace-format
msgid "这些概念相互配合，构成了现代深度学习框架的核心机制 {cite}`goodfellow2016deep`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:43
msgid "本章预览"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"本章我们将从{ref}`computational-graph`开始，建立\"数据流\"的直觉视角。然后理解{ref}`activation-"
"functions`如何用非线性变换在空间中划分决策边界。接着探讨{ref}`loss-"
"functions`如何定义优化目标、塑造损失曲面的几何形状。之后理解{ref}`back-"
"propagation`如何高效地完成\"信用分配\"——把最终误差分摊给每个参数。最后探索{ref}`gradient-"
"descent`如何在损失曲面上寻找最优解。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/introduction.md:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"掌握这些核心机制后，{doc}`the-"
"end`将回顾本章要点，然后下一章我们将用PyTorch构建实际的神经网络，在MNIST任务上观察这些理论如何转化为训练动态。"
msgstr ""

